 <span begin="7.265" end="7.839">things</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">太急了？那晚点你再给我看点不一样的也行</span></p><p begin="9.176" end="11.416" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="9.176" end="9.335">You</span> <span begin="9.335" end="9.440">know</span> <span begin="9.440" end="9.561">what</span> <span begin="9.561" end="9.712">it</span> <span begin="9.712" end="10.077">is</span> <span begin="10.077" end="10.197">whe</span><span begin="10.197" end="10.338">ne</span><span begin="10.338" end="10.465">ver</span> <span begin="10.465" end="10.713">I</span> <span begin="10.713" end="10.906">vi</span><span begin="10.906" end="11.416">sit</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">你知道我来这儿是干嘛的</span></p><p begin="12.695" end="16.439" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="12.695" end="12.935">Win</span><span begin="12.935" end="13.147">dy</span> <span begin="13.147" end="13.407">ci</span><span begin="13.407" end="13.722">ty,</span> <span begin="13.973" end="14.208">she</span> <span begin="14.208" end="14.338">blo</span><span begin="14.338" end="14.458">win&apos;</span> <span begin="14.458" end="14.717">me</span> <span begin="14.717" end="14.915">kis</span><span begin="14.915" end="15.370">ses,</span> <span begin="15.370" end="16.439">no</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">在风城（芝加哥别称）里，她朝我送着飞吻，哦不</span></p><p begin="17.009" end="19.627" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="17.009" end="17.209">Thir</span><span begin="17.209" end="17.344">ty</span> <span begin="17.344" end="17.540">de</span><span begin="17.540" end="18.035">grees,</span> <span begin="18.035" end="18.235">way</span> <span begin="18.235" end="18.506">too</span> <span begin="18.506" end="18.845">cold,</span> <span begin="18.845" end="19.002">so</span> <span begin="19.002" end="19.154">hold</span> <span begin="19.154" end="19.358">me</span> <span begin="19.358" end="19.627">tight</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">零下三十度，冷得够呛，抱紧我</span></p