<p begin="52.698" end="54.463" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="52.698" end="53.027">Hit</span> <span begin="53.027" end="53.304">one,</span> <span begin="53.304" end="53.438">she</span> <span begin="53.438" end="53.617">say</span> <span begin="53.617" end="53.805">she</span> <span begin="53.805" end="53.977">got</span> <span begin="53.977" end="54.139">a</span> <span begin="54.139" end="54.463">man</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">打一个，她说自己已有伴儿</span></p><p begin="54.660" end="56.413" itunes:key="L18" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="54.660" end="54.763">Hit</span> <span begin="54.763" end="55.001">a</span><span begin="55.001" end="55.145">no</span><span begin="55.145" end="55.351">ther</span> <span begin="55.351" end="55.596">one,</span> <span begin="55.596" end="55.714">it</span> <span begin="55.714" end="56.036">goes</span> <span begin="56.036" end="56.413">green</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">再打一个，消息提示变绿（苹果用户给非苹果用户发消息会显示绿色，说明对方换了手机/号码）</span></p><p begin="56.611" end="58.416" itunes:key="L19" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="56.611" end="56.944">Must&apos;ve</span> <span begin="56.944" end="57.292">changed</span> <span begin="57.292" end="57.734">phones</span> <span begin="57.734" end="57.877">on</span> <span begin="57.877" end="58.068">the</span> <span begin="58.068" end="58.416">team</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">肯定是换手机换号了</span></p><p begin="58.568" end="1:00.289" itunes:key="L20" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="58.568" end="58.654">&apos;Mem</span><span begin="58.654" end="58.867">ber</span> <span begin="58.867" end="59.036">when</span> <span begin="59.036" end="59.231">you</span> <span begin="59.231" end="59.404">let</span> <span begin="59.404" end="59.574">me</span> <span begin="59.574" end="59.719">in</span> <span begin="59.719" end="59.927">be</span><span begin="59.927" end="1:00.289">tween</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">还记得你曾接纳我的那段日子吗</span></p><p begin="1:00.506" e