egin="1:08.666" end="1:08.811">found</span> <span begin="1:08.811" end="1:09.019">me</span> <span begin="1:09.019" end="1:09.175">plen</span><span begin="1:09.175" end="1:09.334">ty</span> <span begin="1:09.334" end="1:09.491">in</span> <span begin="1:09.491" end="1:09.621">my</span> <span begin="1:09.621" end="1:10.031">life</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">他这辈子给我牵过不少线</span></p><p begin="1:10.208" end="1:11.971" itunes:key="L26" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:10.208" end="1:10.389">Prob</span><span begin="1:10.389" end="1:10.561">lem</span> <span begin="1:10.561" end="1:10.746">is,</span> <span begin="1:10.746" end="1:10.926">I</span> <span begin="1:10.926" end="1:11.102">meet</span> <span begin="1:11.102" end="1:11.274">a</span> <span begin="1:11.274" end="1:11.452">girl</span> <span begin="1:11.452" end="1:11.681">to</span><span begin="1:11.681" end="1:11.971">night</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">问题是今晚我遇上个姑娘</span></p><p begin="1:12.225" end="1:13.927" itunes:key="L27" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:12.225" end="1:12.322">Then</span> <span begin="1:12.322" end="1:12.496">I</span> <span begin="1:12.496" end="1:12.643">go</span> <span begin="1:12.643" end="1:12.919">and</span> <span begin="1:12.919" end="1:13.087">treat</span> <span begin="1:13.087" end="1:13.299">her</span> <span begin="1:13.299" end="1:13.592">too</span> <span begin="1:13.592" end="1:13.927">nice</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">结果我忍不住对她太好</span></p><p begin="1:14.197" end="1:15.954" itunes:key="L28" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:14.197" end="1:14.319">Gal</span><span begin="1:14.319" end="1:14.490">le</span><span begin="1:14.490" end="1:14.846">ria</span> <span begin="1:14.846" end="1:15.033">cre</span><span begin="1:15.033" end="1:15.184">dit</span> <span begin="1:15.184" end="1:15.563">card</span> <span begin="1:15.563" end="1:15.954">swipes</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">在加莱利亚（休斯顿知名高端商场）刷爆信用卡</span></p><p begin="1:16.193" end="1:17.851" itunes:key="L29" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:16.193" end="1:16.260">I</span> <span begin="1:16.260" end="1:16.449">don&apos;t</span> <span begin="1:16.449" end="1:16.598">e</span><span begin="1:16.598" end="1:16.732">ven</span> <span begin="1:16.732" end="1:16.922">know</span> <span begin="1:16.922" end="1:17.144">if</span> <span begin="1:17.144" end="1:17.237">she</span> <span begin="1:17.237" end="1:17.494">a</span> <span begin="1:17.494" end="1:17.851">wife</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">甚至不知道她是不是有夫之妇</span></p><p begin="1:18.294" end="1:19.852" itunes:key="L30" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:18.294" end="1:18.476">But</span> <span begin="1:18.476" end="1:18.641">I</span> <span begin="1:18.641" end="1:18.812">do</span> <span begin="1:18.812" end="1:19.046">know</span> <span begin="1:19.046" end="1:19.253">one</span> <span begin="1:19.253" end="1:19.500">thing</span> <span begin="1:19.500" end="1:19.852">though</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">但有一件事我清楚</span></p><p begin="1:20.236" end="1:21.782" itunes:key="L31" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:20.236" end="1:20.483">Wo</span><span begin="1:20.483" end="1:20.700">men,</span> <span begin="1:20.700" end="1:20.921">they</span> <span begin="1:20.921" end="1:21.171">come</span> <span begin="1:21.171" end="1:21.391">they</span> <span begin="1:21.391" end="1:21.782">go</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">女人来了又会走</span></p><p begin="1:22.132" end="1:23.889" itunes:key="L32" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:22.132" end="1:22.299">Sa</span><span begin="1:22.299" end="1:22.435">tur</span><span begin="1:22.435" end="1:22.651">day</span> <span begin="1:22.651" end="1:22.897">through</span> <span begin="1:22.897" end="1:23.125">Sun</span><span begin="1:23.125" end="1:23.389">day,</span> <span begin="1:23.389" end="1:23.613">Mon</span><span begin="1:23.613" end="1:23.889">day</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">周六到周日，再到周一</span></p><p begin="1:24.142" end="1:25.697" itunes:key="L33" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:24.142" end="1:24.348">Mon</span><span begin="1:24.348" end="1:24.590">day</span> <span begin="1:24.590" end="1:24.845">through</span> <span begin="1:24.845" end="1:25.096">Sun</span><span begin="1:25.096" end="1:25.328">day,</span> <span begin="1:25.328" end="1:25.697">yo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">周一到周日，哟</span></p><p begin="1:26.069" end="1:27.776" itunes:key="L34" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:26.069" end="1:26.329">May</span><span begin="1:26.329" end="1:26.566">be</span> <span begin="1:26.566" end="1:26.813">I&apos;ll</span> <span begin="1:26.813" end="1:27.045">love</span> <span begin="1:27.045" end="1:27.308">you</span> <span begin="1:27.308" end="1:27.534">one</span> <span begin="1:27.534" end="1:27.776">day</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">说不定哪天我会爱上你</span></p><p begin="1:28.010" end="1:29.637" itunes:key="L35" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:28.010" end="1:28.272">May</span><span begin="1:28.272" end="1:28.506">be</span> <span begin="1:28.506" end="1:28.756">we&apos;ll</span> <span begin="1:28.756" end="1:29.030">some</span><span begin="1:29.030" end="1:29.272">day</span> <span begin="1:29.272" end="1:29.637">grow</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">说不定我们会有未来</span></p><p begin="1:29.976" end="1:32.622" itunes:key="L36" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:29.976" end="1:30.207">&apos;Til</span> <span begin="1:30.207" end="1:30.443">then,</span> <span begin="1:30.443" end="1:30.669">I&apos;ll</span> <span begin="1:30.669" end="1:30.911">sit</span> <span begin="1:30.911" end="1:31.152">my</span> <span begin="1:31.152" end="1:31.386">drunk</span> <span begin="1:31.386" end="1:31.615">ass</span> <span begin="1:31.615" end="1:31.878">on</span> <span begin="1:31.878" end="1:32.149">that</span> <span begin="1:32.149" end="1:32.400">run</span><span begin="1:32.400" end="1:32.622">way</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">在那之前，我就坐我这喝醉的屁股在跑道上（化用Eminem《Superman》的歌词，Drake改得更有旋律感，这里的跑道指即将起飞的航班跑道，暗示他即将奔赴下一站）</span></p><p begin="1:32.622" end="1:33.616" itunes:key="L37" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:32.622" end="1:32.880">On</span> <span begin="1:32.880" end="1:33.134">this</span> <span begin="1:33.134" end="1:33.366">one</span> <span begin="1:33.366" end="1:33.616">way</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">在这条单行道上</span></p><p begin="1:34.093" end="1:37.529" itunes:key="L38" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:34.093" end="1:34.678">Two</span><span begin="1:34.678" end="1:34.932">-thir</span><span begin="1:34.932" end="1:35.183">ty,</span> <span begin="1:35.183" end="1:35.420">ba</span><span begin="1:35.420" end="1:35.662">by,</span> <span begin="1:35.662" end="1:35.882">won&apos;t</span> <span begin="1:35.882" end="1:36.095">you</span> <span begin="1:36.095" end="1:36.336">meet</span> <span begin="1:36.336" end="1:36.563">me</span> <span begin="1:36.563" end="1:36.795">by</span> <span begin="1:36.795" end="1:37.067">The</span> <span begin="1:37.067" end="1:37.529">Bean?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">两点半，宝贝，你能在豆子（芝加哥标志性雕塑“云门”，俗称The Bean）那儿见我吗？</span></p><p begin="1:37.944" end="1:41.522" itunes:key="L39" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:37.944" end="1:38.290">Too</span> <span begin="1:38.572" end="1:38.798">ear</span><span begin="1:38.798" end="1:39.042">ly,</span> <span begin="1:39.042" end="1:39.274">may</span><span begin="1:39.274" end="1:39.510">be</span> <span begin="1:39.510" end="1:39.703">la</span><span begin="1:39.703" end="1:39.962">ter</span> <span begin="1:39.962" end="1:40.155">you</span> <span begin="1:40.155" end="1:40.405">can</span> <span begin="1:40.405" end="1:40.662">show</span> <span begin="1:40.662" end="1:40.913">me</span> <span begin="1:40.913" end="1:41.522">things</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">太急了？那晚点你再给我看点不一样的也行</span></p><p begin="1:42.839" end="1:45.161" itunes:key="L40" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:42.839" end="1:43.053">You</span> <span begin="1:43.053" end="1:43.179">know</span> <span begin="1:43.179" end="1:43.295">what</span> <span begin="1:43.295" end="1:43.438">it</span> <span begin="1:43.438" end="1:43.710">is</span> <span begin="1:43.710" end="1:43.851">whe</span><span begin="1:43.851" end="1:43.998">ne</span><span begin="1:43.998" end="1:44.115">ver</span> <span begin="1:44.115" end="1:44.361">I</span> <span begin="1:44.361" end="1:44.585">vi</span><span begin="1:44.585" end="1:45.161">sit</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">你知道我来这儿是干嘛的</span></p><p begin="1:46.384" end="1:50.065" itunes:key="L41" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:46.384" end="1:46.581">Win</span><span begin="1:46.581" end="1:46.817">dy</span> <span begin="1:46.817" end="1:47.058">ci</span><span begin="1:47.058" end="1:47.407">ty,</span> <span begin="1:47.661" end="1:47.853">she</span> <span begin="1:47.853" end="1:47.968">blo</span><span begin="1:47.968" end="1:48.054">win&apos;</span> <span begin="1:48.054" end="1:48.380">me</span> <span begin="1:48.380" end="1:48.550">kis</span><span begin="1:48.550" end="1:48.982">ses,</span> <span begin="1:48.982" end="1:50.065">no</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">在风城（芝加哥别称）里，她朝我送着飞吻，哦不</span></p><p begin="1:50.672" end="1:53.401" itunes:key="L42" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:50.672" end="1:50.828">Thir</span><span begin="1:50.828" end="1:51.003">ty</span> <span begin="1:51.003" end="1:51.219">de</span><span begin="1:51.219" end="1:51.669">grees,</span> <span begin="1:51.669" end="1:51.886">way</span> <span begin="1:51.886" end="1:52.141">too</span> <span begin="1:52.141" end="1:52.485">cold,</span> <span begin="1:52.485" end="1:52.687">so</span> <span begin="1:52.687" end="1:52.843">hold</span> <span begin="1:52.843" end="1:53.009">me</span> <span begin="1:53.009" end="1:53.401">tight</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">零下三十度，冷得够呛，抱紧我</span></p><p begin="1:54.600" end="1:57.13